WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.065
Peter opened the door.

2
00:00:14.066 --> 00:00:17.265
Flopsy stood there.

3
00:00:17.266 --> 00:00:20.501
She stared at the mess.

4
00:00:20.502 --> 00:00:24.257
"Where is Mrs. Tiggywinkle?" she asked.

5
00:00:24.258 --> 00:00:27.410
Peter wiped soap from his eyes.

6
00:00:27.411 --> 00:00:30.501
"She is on a holiday," he said.

7
00:00:30.502 --> 00:00:35.498
"We are washing the clothes today," Benjamin said.

8
00:00:35.499 --> 00:00:39.807
"Can you wash my red dress?" Flopsy said.

9
00:00:39.808 --> 00:00:44.451
"I need it for a party."

10
00:00:44.452 --> 00:00:50.210
"Um . . ." Peter tried to say no.

11
00:00:50.211 --> 00:00:52.525
But Flopsy waved.

12
00:00:52.526 --> 00:01:01.014
"Thank you! Good-bye!"

13
00:01:01.015 --> 00:01:04.112
Benjamin stomped his foot.

14
00:01:04.113 --> 00:01:11.244
"We will never fly my kite!"

15
00:01:11.245 --> 00:01:17.577
Flopsy hopped down the hill.

16
00:01:17.578 --> 00:01:25.193
Mrs. Tiggywinkle was sitting in the sun.

17
00:01:25.194 --> 00:01:28.752
Mrs. Tiggywinkle waved. "Hello!

18
00:01:28.753 --> 00:01:33.176
I'm on a lovely holiday."

19
00:01:33.177 --> 00:01:36.069
"I know," Flopsy said.

20
00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:39.734
"Peter and Benjamin are washing the clothes."

21
00:01:39.735 --> 00:01:44.327
Mrs. Tiggywinkle gasped. "What?"

22
00:01:44.328 --> 00:01:48.242
"They will wash my red dress," Flopsy said.

23
00:01:48.243 --> 00:01:51.577
Mrs. Tiggywinkle gulped.

24
00:01:51.578 --> 00:01:56.053
"They are making a big mess," Flopsy said.

25
00:01:56.054 --> 00:01:59.754
"There was lots of soap and water."

26
00:01:59.755 --> 00:02:03.424
Mrs. Tiggywinkle leaped up.

27
00:02:03.425 --> 00:02:08.576
She ran home fast.

